WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:32.000
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.250
described the inner

3
00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:35.333
nature of mahatmas.

4
00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:37.916
Now in this verse, He describes their

5
00:00:37.916 --> 00:00:40.791
outward activities and external conduct.

6
00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:42.625
So let us hear.

7
00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:49.083
Who is a mahatma?

8
00:00:49.083 --> 00:00:50.333
As in the previous verse

9
00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:53.708
Lord Krishna told us, those who are mahatmas

10
00:00:53.708 --> 00:00:56.250
always sing His glories.

11
00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:57.583
Whom in this verse

12
00:00:57.583 --> 00:01:01.375
Lord Krishna addresses as
 'satatam kirtayanto mam' –

13
00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:03.250
those who always sing of Me.

14
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:07.375
In their hearts, only 
Lord Krishna's name resonates.

15
00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:09.250
They chant His name,

16
00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.750
they recite His divine pastimes,

17
00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:14.375
and in this devotion they remain 'satatam' –

18
00:01:14.375 --> 00:01:15.625
without pause,

19
00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:19.500
without fatigue, without any lessening of joy.

20
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:20.958
In a mahatma's life, Lord Krishna

21
00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:22.625
is that stream of love

22
00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:25.583
that never stops, never ceases.

23
00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:28.541
They are always absorbed in Lord Krishna.

24
00:01:28.541 --> 00:01:29.541
But

25
00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:32.541
is feeling alone enough?

26
00:01:32.541 --> 00:01:33.291
No.

27
00:01:33.291 --> 00:01:35.666
In this verse, Lord Krishna

28
00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:37.375
describes the mahatmas' devotion

29
00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:40.791
as 'yatantash cha dridhavratah.'

30
00:01:40.791 --> 00:01:41.541
Meaning,

31
00:01:41.541 --> 00:01:44.458
mahatmas remain steadfast in their resolve.

32
00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:47.208
Their devotion is not just the softness of the heart,

33
00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:50.541
but also the power of firmness and resolve.

34
00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:52.458
They do not simply flow with emotion,

35
00:01:52.458 --> 00:01:55.583
but remain unwavering in their discipline.

36
00:01:55.583 --> 00:01:58.916
Whether it is fasting, regulated chanting,

37
00:01:58.916 --> 00:02:01.708
or service – they do not waver.

38
00:02:01.708 --> 00:02:03.500
In a mahatma's life, devotion

39
00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:05.500
is not a one-day practice,

40
00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.916
but the whole of life.

41
00:02:07.916 --> 00:02:09.458
And it is not the case

42
00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:10.875
that such a mahatma's mind

43
00:02:10.875 --> 00:02:12.833
ever lets ego enter.

44
00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:13.750
They always

45
00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:15.833
in the Lord's devotion surrender themselves

46
00:02:15.833 --> 00:02:18.166
with complete reverence.

47
00:02:18.166 --> 00:02:21.083
'Namasyantash cha mam bhaktya' – meaning

48
00:02:21.083 --> 00:02:24.083
their surrender is not just a physical act,

49
00:02:24.083 --> 00:02:27.541
but the soul's acceptance that – 'Lord,

50
00:02:27.541 --> 00:02:29.916
You are my everything.'

51
00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:32.333
This surrender is not of the body,

52
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:34.708
but the dissolution of the ego.

53
00:02:34.708 --> 00:02:37.500
For them, humility is not a formality

54
00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.208
but the natural expression of devotion.

55
00:02:40.208 --> 00:02:44.541
But does this feeling ever fade?

56
00:02:44.541 --> 00:02:47.666
No, this bond is 'nitya-yuktah' –

57
00:02:47.666 --> 00:02:51.458
meaning they are always
 connected to Lord Krishna.

58
00:02:51.458 --> 00:02:54.250
This connection is not momentary,
not dependent on

59
00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:57.333
circumstances, not affected by joy or sorrow.

60
00:02:57.333 --> 00:03:00.916
It is unbreakable, unwavering, and whole.

61
00:03:00.916 --> 00:03:03.500
Not just at the time of prayer, but

62
00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:06.583
in every action of life, in every thought,

63
00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:07.625
in every interaction,

64
00:03:07.625 --> 00:03:10.708
everywhere they remain
 surrendered to Lord Krishna.

65
00:03:10.708 --> 00:03:13.291
A life where every breath

66
00:03:13.291 --> 00:03:15.208
is a chanting of Lord Krishna's name,

67
00:03:15.208 --> 00:03:17.666
every action is service to Lord Krishna,

68
00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:21.208
and every thought is 
offered at Lord Krishna's feet.

69
00:03:21.208 --> 00:03:23.125
And Lord Krishna says,

70
00:03:23.125 --> 00:03:25.875
this is the life of a mahatma,

71
00:03:25.875 --> 00:03:29.291
and such a life becomes an inspiration for us

72
00:03:29.291 --> 00:03:32.458
and tells us the meaning of true happiness –

73
00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:34.791
that happiness lies in devotion,

74
00:03:34.791 --> 00:03:37.750
not in material things.

75
00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.666
In life,

76
00:03:43.666 --> 00:03:48.208
to achieve success in any area,

77
00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:50.750
true sincerity and dedication

78
00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:55.250
in your work are essential.

79
00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.041
But what does

80
00:03:57.041 --> 00:04:00.416
true sincerity look like?

81
00:04:00.416 --> 00:04:04.833
Is it just a short burst of effort,

82
00:04:04.833 --> 00:04:08.875
or is it the name of consistency,

83
00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:13.500
and how do you build it within yourself?

84
00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:14.875
For this,

85
00:04:14.875 --> 00:04:18.791
this verse gives four qualities

86
00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:22.416
that are essential not only for the spiritual path,

87
00:04:22.416 --> 00:04:28.666
but for every area of life.

88
00:04:28.666 --> 00:04:30.416
They are –

89
00:04:30.416 --> 00:04:33.500
consistency, resolve,

90
00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:36.416
humility, and patience.

91
00:04:36.416 --> 00:04:39.916
Just as mahatmas

92
00:04:39.916 --> 00:04:44.541
sing Lord Krishna's glories every day,

93
00:04:44.541 --> 00:04:46.708
that is true sincerity.

94
00:04:46.708 --> 00:04:51.791
Every day, every moment, 
without stopping, without tiring.

95
00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:56.708
In the same way, look at your own life.

96
00:04:56.708 --> 00:04:59.333
Are you that dedicated

97
00:04:59.333 --> 00:05:02.000
to your goal?

98
00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:06.583
Are you working on it every day,

99
00:05:06.583 --> 00:05:09.916
whether anyone is watching or not?

100
00:05:09.916 --> 00:05:12.041
Just as mahatmas

101
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:15.583
remain firm in their discipline,

102
00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:18.791
that is true resolve.

103
00:05:18.791 --> 00:05:22.833
Standing unwavering on your principles,

104
00:05:22.833 --> 00:05:26.750
whatever the situation may be.

105
00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.500
Not losing sight

106
00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:32.250
of your goal.

107
00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:37.000
Are you also holding firm to your resolves,

108
00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.541
or are you simply changing the rules

109
00:05:39.541 --> 00:05:42.125
to suit your convenience?

110
00:05:42.125 --> 00:05:47.833
Just as mahatmas bow before Lord Krishna?

111
00:05:47.833 --> 00:05:50.791
That is true humility.

112
00:05:50.791 --> 00:05:54.833
Letting go of ego and accepting

113
00:05:54.833 --> 00:05:58.041
that the process of learning and improving

114
00:05:58.041 --> 00:06:01.208
never ends.

115
00:06:01.208 --> 00:06:02.666
Do you also

116
00:06:02.666 --> 00:06:05.875
accept your mistakes?

117
00:06:05.875 --> 00:06:07.916
Do you also appreciate

118
00:06:07.916 --> 00:06:11.791
the contributions of others?

119
00:06:11.791 --> 00:06:15.125
And most importantly –

120
00:06:15.125 --> 00:06:20.333
they remain ever engaged in My worship.

121
00:06:20.333 --> 00:06:23.666
That is true patience.

122
00:06:23.666 --> 00:06:26.625
Understanding that great goals

123
00:06:26.625 --> 00:06:30.416
are not achieved in a day, but

124
00:06:30.416 --> 00:06:34.625
with consistent effort, everything is possible.

125
00:06:34.625 --> 00:06:39.750
Do you also stay connected to your purpose,

126
00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:46.125
or do you give up when a little difficulty comes?

127
00:06:46.125 --> 00:06:47.250
If you

128
00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:51.458
adopt these four qualities, you will find in life not

129
00:06:51.458 --> 00:06:55.208
only success but also

130
00:06:55.208 --> 00:06:58.833
deep inner contentment.

131
00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.083
It is commonly seen

132
00:07:06.083 --> 00:07:08.833
that parents want

133
00:07:08.833 --> 00:07:13.583
their child to always be safe.

134
00:07:13.583 --> 00:07:15.500
But is it

135
00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:20.708
possible to always keep children close?

136
00:07:20.708 --> 00:07:22.125
No.

137
00:07:22.125 --> 00:07:23.250
That is why,

138
00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:27.375
more important than keeping children safe

139
00:07:27.375 --> 00:07:29.791
is making them strong,

140
00:07:29.791 --> 00:07:33.125
and you can build your children's

141
00:07:33.125 --> 00:07:34.916
character by teaching them

142
00:07:34.916 --> 00:07:38.083
these four life values described in this verse,

143
00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:42.333
strengthening their personality.

144
00:07:42.333 --> 00:07:47.250
Consistency, resolve, humility, and patience –

145
00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:50.083
these are the four values.

146
00:07:50.083 --> 00:07:52.666
Teach them that just as

147
00:07:52.666 --> 00:07:56.250
mahatmas chant continuously,

148
00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:59.750
in the same way, for any goal in life

149
00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.750
consistency is essential.

150
00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:08.125
If they maintain regularity in their efforts,

151
00:08:08.125 --> 00:08:11.458
no goal will remain out of reach.

152
00:08:11.458 --> 00:08:12.833
After that,

153
00:08:12.833 --> 00:08:17.208
help them understand the value of resolve –

154
00:08:17.208 --> 00:08:18.791
that the path of life

155
00:08:18.791 --> 00:08:22.708
is full of challenges, but

156
00:08:22.708 --> 00:08:24.416
those who remain firm

157
00:08:24.416 --> 00:08:27.750
on their principles and values

158
00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:30.416
are the ones who find true success.

159
00:08:30.416 --> 00:08:34.291
The third life value – humility.

160
00:08:34.291 --> 00:08:37.916
Teach them humility.

161
00:08:37.916 --> 00:08:43.500
Show them that something
can be learnt from everyone.

162
00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:48.250
And then help them understand
the importance of patience.

163
00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.750
Try to tell them

164
00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:55.125
that success does not come in a single day,

165
00:08:55.125 --> 00:08:59.750
but if they stay on the right path,

166
00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.500
results will certainly come.

167
00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:03.541
If these four

168
00:09:03.541 --> 00:09:06.541
values develop in children,

169
00:09:06.541 --> 00:09:10.500
they will not only be successful in life, but will

170
00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.958
also become people of character
and balanced individuals.

171
00:09:19.541 --> 00:09:21.916
At the workplace, consistency,

172
00:09:21.916 --> 00:09:26.291
resolve, humility, and patience –

173
00:09:26.291 --> 00:09:30.000
these four qualities are the keys to success.

174
00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.750
Ask yourself a few questions.

175
00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:37.166
Do you maintain consistency?

176
00:09:37.166 --> 00:09:39.750
If not, pay attention.

177
00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:40.916
The person who

178
00:09:40.916 --> 00:09:44.166
brings regularity to their work

179
00:09:44.166 --> 00:09:48.375
gradually earns expertise.

180
00:09:48.375 --> 00:09:51.416
Again, ask yourself a question.

181
00:09:51.416 --> 00:09:55.750
Are you firm in your resolve?

182
00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:56.750
See,

183
00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:59.666
challenges come in every field,

184
00:09:59.666 --> 00:10:00.458
but

185
00:10:00.458 --> 00:10:03.666
those who remain committed to their work

186
00:10:03.666 --> 00:10:06.875
become leaders in their field.

187
00:10:06.875 --> 00:10:09.875
Also ask this question –

188
00:10:09.875 --> 00:10:12.875
are you humble?

189
00:10:12.875 --> 00:10:15.333
See, humility

190
00:10:15.333 --> 00:10:17.875
is absolutely essential in life,

191
00:10:17.875 --> 00:10:20.958
and true leadership is one

192
00:10:20.958 --> 00:10:23.833
that stays humble with all,

193
00:10:23.833 --> 00:10:28.208
that encourages cooperation,
learns from others,

194
00:10:28.208 --> 00:10:31.833
and makes decisions free from ego.

195
00:10:31.833 --> 00:10:35.333
And do you have patience?

196
00:10:35.333 --> 00:10:39.666
Remember, every success takes time,

197
00:10:39.666 --> 00:10:43.041
but the person who thinks big

198
00:10:43.041 --> 00:10:45.833
and keeps making consistent effort,

199
00:10:45.833 --> 00:10:48.875
that person is the one who brings real change.

200
00:10:48.875 --> 00:10:51.083
And if these four qualities

201
00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:53.458
are adopted at the workplace,

202
00:10:53.458 --> 00:10:56.041
not only will you grow,

203
00:10:56.041 --> 00:11:01.458
but the entire organisation
will rise to a new height.
